2026-10-28T18:45:58.359Z {"kind":"console.info","msg":"%c%s%s:%s color:#f90;font-size:12px;  [15:45:58:349][info] PetData.changeSkills 754401,754501,751201,750201,749201,7064001 null [{\"propSontypeArr\":[9001,9002,9003,9004,9005,9006,9007,9008,9009,9010],\"TemplateName\":\"\",\"TemplateName_en\":\"Holy Vow\",\"TemplateName_es\":\"Juramento sagrado\",\"TemplateName_fr\":\"Vœu sacré\",\"TemplateName_pt\":\"Voto Sagrado\",\"TemplateName_tr\":\"Kutsal Söz\",\"TemplateName_zhcn\":\"圣言术\",\"TemplateName_zhtw\":\"聖言術\",\"UseCount\":\"\",\"Description\":\"\",\"Description_en\":\"Restores 20% of Max HP to yourself and dispels 2 debuffs; increases Block rate by 30%, lasts 3 turns.\",\"Description_es\":\"Restaura un 20% de tus PS Máx. y disipa 2 efectos negativos; aumenta un 30% la Tasa de Bloqueo durante 3 turnos.\",\"Description_fr\":\"Restaure 20 % des PV Max pour vous-même et dissipe 2 affaiblissements ; augmente le taux de blocage de 30 % pendant 3 tours.\",\"Description_pt\":\"Restaura 20% do PV Máx. para você e dissipa 2 penalidades; aumenta a taxa de Bloqueio em 30%, dura 3 turnos.\",\"Description_tr\":\"Kendine %20 maks. HP ekler, 2 zararlı etkiyi temizler, aynı anda bloke oranı %30 artar, 3 tur sürer.\",\"Description_zhcn\":\"使自身恢复20%最大生命，并净化2个有害效果，同时使自身格挡率提高30%，持续3回合。\",\"Description_zhtw\":\"使自身恢復20%最大生命，並淨化2個有害效果，同時使自身格擋率提高30%，持續3回合。\",\"DescriptionKey\":\"Description\",\"TemplateNameKey\":\"TemplateName\",\"_skillBeforeRunCdTime\":0,\"_AcceptObject\":4,\"ActionId\":7544,\"AppearCD\":0,\"AppearTime\":1,\"BufferIds\":\"754401,754402,754403\",\"CastTime\":4500,\"_CoolDown\":45000,\"_Cost\":0,\"CountWay\":10,\"Crucial\":0,\"DefaultTarget\":0,\"Description_de\":\"Stellt 20% der Max-LP von dir wieder her und entfernt 2 Debuffs. Erhöht Block-Rate um 30%. Dauert 3 Runden.\",\"Description_id\":\"Memulihkan 20% HP Maksimal dirimu dan menghilangkan 2 debuff; meningkatkan rasio Blokir sebanyak 30%, berlangsung selama 3 putaran.\",\"Description_nl\":\"Herstelt 20% van je max