2026-10-28T23:08:55.057Z {"kind":"console.info","msg":"%c%s%s:%s color:#f90;font-size:12px;  [20:8:55:1][info] PetData.changeSkills 754401,754501,751201,750201,749201,7064001 null [{\"propSontypeArr\":[9001,9002,9003,9004,9005,9006,9007,9008,9009,9010],\"TemplateName\":\"\",\"TemplateName_en\":\"Holy Vow\",\"TemplateName_es\":\"Juramento sagrado\",\"TemplateName_fr\":\"Vœu sacré\",\"TemplateName_pt\":\"Voto Sagrado\",\"TemplateName_tr\":\"Kutsal Söz\",\"TemplateName_zhcn\":\"圣言术\",\"TemplateName_zhtw\":\"聖言術\",\"UseCount\":\"\",\"Description\":\"\",\"Description_en\":\"Restores 20% of Max HP to yourself and dispels 2 debuffs; increases Block rate by 30%, lasts 3 turns.\",\"Description_es\":\"Restaura un 20% de tus PS Máx. y disipa 2 efectos negativos; aumenta un 30% la Tasa de Bloqueo durante 3 turnos.\",\"Description_fr\":\"Restaure 20 % des PV Max pour vous-même et dissipe 2 affaiblissements ; augmente le taux de blocage de 30 % pendant 3 tours.\",\"Description_pt\":\"Restaura 20% do PV Máx. para você e dissipa 2 penalidades; aumenta a taxa de Bloqueio em 30%, dura 3 turnos.\",\"Description_tr\":\"Kendine %20 maks. HP ekler, 2 zararlı etkiyi temizler, aynı anda bloke oranı %30 artar, 3 tur sürer.\",\"Description_zhcn\":\"使自身恢复20%最大生命，并净化2个有害效果，同时使自身格挡率提高30%，持续3回合。\",\"Description_zhtw\":\"使自身恢復20%最大生命，並淨化2個有害效果，同時使自身格擋率提高30%，持續3回合。\",\"DescriptionKey\":\"Description\",\"TemplateNameKey\":\"TemplateName\",\"_skillBeforeRunCdTime\":0,\"_AcceptObject\":4,\"ActionId\":7544,\"AppearCD\":0,\"AppearTime\":1,\"BufferIds\":\"754401,754402,754403\",\"CastTime\":4500,\"_CoolDown\":45000,\"_Cost\":0,\"CountWay\":10,\"Crucial\":0,\"DefaultTarget\":0,\"Description_de\":\"Stellt 20% der Max-LP von dir wieder her und entfernt 2 Debuffs. Erhöht Block-Rate um 30%. Dauert 3 Runden.\",\"Description_id\":\"Memulihkan 20% HP Maksimal dirimu dan menghilangkan 2 debuff; meningkatkan rasio Blokir sebanyak 30%, berlangsung selama 3 putaran.\",\"Description_nl\":\"Herstelt 20% van je maximale HP en verwijdert 2 debuffs; verhoogt de blokkeringskans met 30%, duurt 3 beurten.\",\"Description_pl\":\"Przywraca ci 20% maks. PŻ i rozprasza 2 osłabienia; zwiększa szansę na blok o 30%, trwa 3 tury.\",\"Description_ru\":\"Восстанавливает персонажу 20% от макс. здоровья, рассеивает 2 негативных эффекта и повышает шанс блока на 30%. Длительность – 3 хода.\",\"Description_th\":\"ฟื้นฟู พลังชีวิต สูงสุด 20% ให้กับตัวเองและลบล้างดีบัฟ 2 อย่าง เพิ่มอัตราการบล็อค 30% เป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์น\",\"EnemyRequirements\":\"\",\"Grades\":1,\"Icons\":\"/pet_light15.png\",\"Index\":0,\"IsDelphic\":0,\"IsResistDead\":0,\"IsUseOnDead\":0,\"MasterType\":106,\"NeedPlayerGrade\":60,\"NextTemplateId\":0,\"OwnRequirements\":\"\",\"Parameter1\":0,\"Parameter2\":0,\"Parameter3\":22,\"Parameter4\":1,\"PreTemplateId\":\"\",\"Priority\":2,\"ProperType\":0,\"QteTime\":0,\"SkillRandom\":100,\"SonType\":7544,\"TemplateId\":754401,\"TemplateName_de\":\"Heiliger Schwur\",\"TemplateName_id\":\"Sumpah Suci\",\"TemplateName_nl\":\"Heilige Gelofte\",\"TemplateName_pl\":\"Święta Przysięga\",\"TemplateName_ru\":\"Священные слова\",\"TemplateName_th\":\"คำปฏิญาณอันศักดิ์สิทธิ์\",\"UseWay\":1},{\"propSontypeArr\":[9001,9002,9003,9004,9005,9006,9007,9008,9009,9010],\"TemplateName\":\"\",\"TemplateName_en\":\"Redeeming Light\",\"TemplateName_es\":\"Luz redentora\",\"TemplateName_fr\":\"Lumière rédemptrice\",\"TemplateName_pt\":\"Luz Redentora\",\"TemplateName_tr\":\"Kutsal Aydınlık\",\"TemplateName_zhcn\":\"圣光洗涤\",\"TemplateName_zhtw\":\"聖光洗滌\",\"UseCount\":\"\",\"Description\":\"\",\"Description_en\":\"When blocking an attack, decreases the chance of receiving Crit Hit by 10% for 3 turns, stacking up to 3 times.\",\"Description_es\":\"Al bloquear un ataque reduce un 10% la probabilidad de recibir Golpes CRIT durante 3 turnos. Se puede acumular hasta 3 veces.\",\"Description_fr\":\"Lors d'un blocage d'attaque, réduit la chance de subir un Coup CRIT de 10 % pendant 3 tours, cumulable jusqu'à 3 fois.\",\"Descrip