2026-10-29T19:30:57.306Z {"kind":"console.info","msg":"%c%s%s:%s color:#f90;font-size:12px;  [16:30:56:947][info] PetData.changeSkills 754501,751201,750201,749201,7065001,7064001,7063001,754301,753101 null [{\"propSontypeArr\":[9001,9002,9003,9004,9005,9006,9007,9008,9009,9010],\"TemplateName\":\"\",\"TemplateName_en\":\"Redeeming Light\",\"TemplateName_es\":\"Luz redentora\",\"TemplateName_fr\":\"Lumière rédemptrice\",\"TemplateName_pt\":\"Luz Redentora\",\"TemplateName_tr\":\"Kutsal Aydınlık\",\"TemplateName_zhcn\":\"圣光洗涤\",\"TemplateName_zhtw\":\"聖光洗滌\",\"UseCount\":\"\",\"Description\":\"\",\"Description_en\":\"When blocking an attack, decreases the chance of receiving Crit Hit by 10% for 3 turns, stacking up to 3 times.\",\"Description_es\":\"Al bloquear un ataque reduce un 10% la probabilidad de recibir Golpes CRIT durante 3 turnos. Se puede acumular hasta 3 veces.\",\"Description_fr\":\"Lors d'un blocage d'attaque, réduit la chance de subir un Coup CRIT de 10 % pendant 3 tours, cumulable jusqu'à 3 fois.\",\"Description_pt\":\"Ao bloquear um ataque, diminui a chance de sofrer Acerto Crít. em 10% por 3 turnos, acumulando até 3 vezes.\",\"Description_tr\":\"Bloke anında, kendi aldığı hasar olasılığı %5 azalır, 3 tur sürer, 3 kat artar.\",\"Description_zhcn\":\"格挡时，使自身受到暴击几率降低10%，持续3回合，可叠加3层。\",\"Description_zhtw\":\"格擋時，使自身受到暴擊幾率降低10%，持續3回合，可疊加3層。\",\"DescriptionKey\":\"Description\",\"TemplateNameKey\":\"TemplateName\",\"_skillBeforeRunCdTime\":0,\"_AcceptObject\":4,\"ActionId\":0,\"AppearCD\":0,\"AppearTime\":1,\"BufferIds\":\"754501\",\"CastTime\":0,\"_CoolDown\":0,\"_Cost\":0,\"CountWay\":10,\"Crucial\":0,\"DefaultTarget\":0,\"Description_de\":\"Wenn man einen Angriff blockiert, reduziert die Chance, einen kritischen Treffer zu erleiden, um 10% für 3 Runden, kann bis zu 3 Mal gestapelt werden.\",\"Description_id\":\"Saat memblokir serangan, mengurangi peluang menerima Serangan Kritis sebesar 10% selama 3 putaran, dapat ditumpuk hingga 3 kali.\",\"Description_nl\":\"Bij het blokkeren van een aanval wordt de kans op een Krit treffer 3 beurten lang met 10% verlaagd. Dit kan maximaal 3 keer worden gestapeld.\",\"Description_pl\":\"Podczas blokowania ataku zmniejsza szansę na otrzymanie trafienia Kryt o 10% na 3 tury, kumulując się do maksymalnie 3 razy.\",\"Description_ru\":\"При блоке шанс входящего крита снижается на 10% на 3 хода. Суммируется до 3 раз.\",\"Description_th\":\"เมื่อบล็อกการโจมตี โอกาสในการได้รับการโจมตีคริติคอลจะลดลง 10% เป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์น โดยสามารถซ้อนทับได้สูงสุด 3 ครั้ง\",\"EnemyRequirements\":\"\",\"Grades\":1,\"Icons\":\"/pet_light16.png\",\"Index\":0,\"IsDelphic\":0,\"IsResistDead\":0,\"IsUseOnDead\":0,\"MasterType\":106,\"NeedPlayerGrade\":60,\"NextTemplateId\":0,\"OwnRequirements\":\"\",\"Parameter1\":0,\"Parameter2\":0,\"Parameter3\":20,\"Parameter4\":1,\"PreTemplateId\":\"\",\"Priority\":0,\"ProperType\":0,\"QteTime\":0,\"SkillRandom\":100,\"SonType\":7545,\"TemplateId\":754501,\"TemplateName_de\":\"Erlösendes Licht\",\"TemplateName_id\":\"Cahaya Penebus\",\"TemplateName_nl\":\"Verlossend licht\",\"TemplateName_pl\":\"Odkupiające Światło\",\"TemplateName_ru\":\"Очищение светом\",\"TemplateName_th\":\"แสงแห่งการไถ่บาป\",\"UseWay\":2},{\"propSontypeArr\":[9001,9002,9003,9004,9005,9006,9007,9008,9009,9010],\"TemplateName\":\"\",\"TemplateName_en\":\"Master of Light\",\"TemplateName_es\":\"Dominio de la luz\",\"TemplateName_fr\":\"Maître de la lumière\",\"TemplateName_pt\":\"Maestria da Luz\",\"TemplateName_tr\":\"Elit Aydınlık\",\"TemplateName_zhcn\":\"光系精通\",\"TemplateName_zhtw\":\"光系精通\",\"UseCount\":\"\",\"Description\":\"\",\"Description_en\":\"When dealing DMG, decreases the targets' Block Rate by 10% for 3 turns and stackable (up to 3 stakcs).\",\"Description_es\":\"Al infligir Daño se reduce un 10% la tasa de bloqueo de los objetivos durante 3 turnos. Se pueden acumular hasta 3 capas.\",\"Description_fr\":\"Lorsqu’il inflige des DGT, diminue le taux de blocage des cibles de 10 %, ce qui peut être cumulé jusqu'à 3 fois et dure 3 tours.\",\"Description_pt\":\"Ao causar DANO, diminui a taxa de bloqueio dos alvos em 10% por 3 turnos e pode acumular (até 3 acúmulos).\",\"Description_tr\":\"Hasar oluşturma anında kendi bloke oranı %15 , düşer, 3 tur sürer, 3 kez artar.\",\"Description_zhcn\":\"造成伤害时，同时使目标的格挡率下降10%，持续3","t":1793302256947,"ua":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}
