2026-10-29T19:30:57.312Z {"kind":"console.info","msg":"%c%s%s:%s color:#f90;font-size:12px;  [16:30:56:952][info] PetData.changeSkills 7055001,7054001,7051001 null [{\"propSontypeArr\":[9001,9002,9003,9004,9005,9006,9007,9008,9009,9010],\"TemplateName\":\"\",\"TemplateName_en\":\"Shadow Arrow\",\"TemplateName_es\":\"Flecha Oscura\",\"TemplateName_fr\":\"Flèche Obscure\",\"TemplateName_pt\":\"Flecha Sombria\",\"TemplateName_tr\":\"Karanlık Ok\",\"TemplateName_zhcn\":\"暗箭\",\"TemplateName_zhtw\":\"暗箭\",\"UseCount\":\"\",\"Description\":\"\",\"Description_en\":\"Deal {Parameter1}% PDMG to 2 random enemies and increase Crit Rate by 30% for 3 turns\",\"Description_es\":\"Inflige {Parameter1}% de DAÑO F. a 2 enemigos aleatorios y aumenta la probabilidad de crítico del usuario en 30% durante 3 turnos.\",\"Description_fr\":\"Inflige {Parameter1}% de DGT PHY à 2 ennemis aléatoires et augmente le taux de critique de l’utilisateur de 30% pendant 3 tours.\",\"Description_pt\":\"Causa {Parameter1}% de DANO FIS a 2 inimigos aleatórios e aumenta a taxa de crítico do usuário em 30% por 3 turnos.\",\"Description_tr\":\"Rastgele 2 düşman birimine %{Parameter1} fiziksel hasar oluşturur, kendi kritik saldırı olasılığı %30 artar, 3 tur sürer.\",\"Description_zhcn\":\"对敌方随机2个单位造成{Parameter1}%物理型伤害，同时使自身暴击率提高30%，持续3回合。\",\"Description_zhtw\":\"對敵方隨機2個單位造成{Parameter1}%物理型傷害，同時使自身暴擊率提高30%，持續3回合。\",\"DescriptionKey\":\"Description\",\"TemplateNameKey\":\"TemplateName\",\"_skillBeforeRunCdTime\":0,\"_AcceptObject\":12,\"ActionId\":7501,\"AppearCD\":0,\"AppearTime\":2,\"BufferIds\":7055001,\"CastTime\":4500,\"_CoolDown\":15000,\"_Cost\":0,\"CountWay\":9,\"Crucial\":0,\"DefaultTarget\":0,\"Description_de\":\"Fügt 2 zufälligen Gegnern {Parameter1}% P-SCH zu und erhöht die Kritische Trefferchance des Anwenders um 30% für 3 Runden.\",\"Description_id\":\"Memberikan {Parameter1}% PDMG kepada 2 musuh acak dan meningkatkan peluang kritikal pengguna sebesar 30% selama 3 ronde.\",\"Description_nl\":\"B